  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Scale IO Graph bar widths to the interval",
  "description": "This prevents bars from overlapping when intervals smaller than 1 sec\nare used, and prevents huge gaps when larger intervals are used.\n\nThe default QCustomPlot width is 0.75 of the x-coordinate axis, which\ncreates a gap when the interval is 1 s. We could multiply by 0.75\nto have that effect.\n\nRelated to #17422, as it makes it easier to have the pen color for\nthe bars the same as the brush color.\n\nRelated to #13682, because bars are nigh useless on smaller\ninterals without scaling the width.",
  "state": "merged",
